  { icon: '🍽', title: 'Omani Coffee & Dates', text: 'When visiting an Omani home or business, you\'ll be offered kahwa (cardamom-spiced coffee) and dates. Always accept with your right hand. Shake the cup side to side when you\'ve had enough. This ritual is central to Omani hospitality.' },
  { icon: '🕌', title: 'Mosque Etiquette', text: 'The Grand Mosque is open to non-Muslims only Saturday to Thursday, 8–11am. Cover all skin except face and hands. Women must cover their hair. Photography is allowed in the courtyard. Remove shoes at the entrance. Don\'t walk in front of anyone praying.' },
